  "description": "From the Void We Ascend, Through Shadows We Dominate.\n\n=================================\n&quot;Try to stay active, and do the guild challenges as much as you can.&quot;\n\n=================================\n\nHey Guildmates!\nWe’re launching scheduled RAID events open for all regions. Please mark your calendars and match your local time zones with the following UTC times:\n\n🔻🔻🔻🔻\n\nRAID Times (Every Monday, Wednesday, Saturday ):\n\n🔸\n\n05:00 UTC 🌏 → 12:00 WIB (🇮🇩)\n\n14:00 UTC 🌏→ 21:00 WIB (🇮🇩)\n\n🔸\n\nYou can convert these UTC times to your local time using time.is/UTC or any world clock converter.\n\n🔸\n\nLet’s prepare and bring glory to the guild!",
